<title>USA: Clayton Williams to buy back $2 mln of stk.</title>
<headline>Clayton Williams to buy back $2 mln of stk.</headline>
<dateline>MIDLAND, Texas 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clayton Williams Energy Inc said Monday its board had approved buying back up to $2 million of its stock in 1997.</p>
<p>The repurchases in the open market will be subject to product prices remaining at acceptable levels, and other factors, the company said.</p>
<p>Favorable oil and natural gas prices have enabled the company to buy back stock while maintaining its planned capital spending, Clayton Williams said.</p>
</text>
